arguments.argument:
mybacktimer = 50+random(250)//This is the time mangle stays in the office's right vent before leaving
backtimer = mybacktimer
mymovetime = 200+random(1200)//This is the time the animatronic takes to move. Change this to any value you want.
movetime = 300+random(1000)//This is the initial time the animatronic takes to move to the second phase in mangle Cove. Change this to any value you want.
